      "content": "a moment of peace won't stay. once the gates break, the noise won't stop. it'll just be the screams and the fire. i'd rather have the silence now while i still have a choice, instead of waiting for them to take it from me. it's better to go out on my own terms than to be broken by them, isn't it?",
